WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560
Chen Zhenghang, a famous social gangster nicknamed Brother Hao

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:03,640
When you broke into my house

3
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:06,200
It's Xu Hao, the leader of Kaishan Mansion, who he holds in his hand

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,680
Arrogant and domineering rich second generation

5
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:11,250
Said it used to be ten thousand

6
00:00:11,810 --> 00:00:13,130
If you are timid at this time

7
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:15,210
Will definitely become the laughing stock of everyone

8
00:00:15,770 --> 00:00:20,050
And no one will listen to my orders in the future. This is no good, family.

9
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:21,250
The community is my home

10
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:22,370
It’s up to everyone to clear the snow

11
00:00:22,610 --> 00:00:23,850
I hope my family will be free

12
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:24,930
You can bring tools

13
00:00:24,930 --> 00:00:26,290
Go out and clear the snow together

14
00:00:26,610 --> 00:00:35,880
With that much snow?

15
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:40,770
It's none of my business if you clear the snow.

16
00:00:40,770 --> 00:00:42,010
I don’t have to go to work

17
00:00:42,010 --> 00:00:43,810
It doesn’t matter if you sleep at home every day

18
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:47,420
It’s all Zhang Yi’s shit

19
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:49,620
Zhang Yi, who ruined my good deeds

20
00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:51,340
Are you deliberately trying to make things difficult for me?

21
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:52,660
Tell me what you want to do

22
00:00:52,660 --> 00:00:53,980
I asked everyone to go out and clear the snow

23
00:00:53,980 --> 00:00:55,660
Does everyone need to go out?

24
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:56,820
It's better now

25
00:00:56,820 --> 00:00:57,860
Everyone quits

26
00:00:58,100 --> 00:00:59,900
Do we have to stay at home all the time?

27
00:01:03,650 --> 00:01:04,930
There are also people who come to your door to scold you.
